* ==================================================================
* YONGYUTAI SI2300 (LCSC C2891729) -- SPICE model
* N-Channel 20 V TrenchFET Power MOSFET, SOT-23-3L
* Package pinout:  1 = GATE,  2 = SOURCE,  3 = DRAIN (marking "2300")
*
* Calibrated to datasheet TYPICAL curves at 25 degC:
*   RDS(on) ~ 24 mOhm @ VGS=4.5 V   (datasheet graph ~ 25-30 mOhm)
*   RDS(on) ~ 45 mOhm @ VGS=2.5 V   (datasheet graph ~ 40 mOhm)
*   Vth      ~ 1.0 V
*   Transfer curve: ~ 10 A @ VGS = 2.1 V (pulsed)
*   Continuous rating class: ~ 4.5 A
*
* Model type: LEVEL=3  (ngspice / KiCad 10 / LTspice compatible)
* NOTE: no avalanche breakdown is modeled -- respect VDS < 20 V.
* ==================================================================
.SUBCKT SI2300 D G S
M1 D G S S SI2300CH W=1 L=1
.MODEL SI2300CH NMOS (
+ LEVEL=3    VTO=1.0     KP=18        GAMMA=0    PHI=0.6
+ RS=0.004   RD=0.004    RDS=1G       TOX=50N
+ IS=1E-11   N=1.0
+ CGSO=50P   CGDO=50P    CGBO=10P
+ CJ=0.5M    MJ=0.5      CJSW=0.1N    MJSW=0.33
+ LAMBDA=0.05  THETA=0.02  KAPPA=0.5
+ )
.ENDS SI2300
